{"lyrics":"[Intro: Lil Durk & Juice WRLD]\n[00:02.02]Oh, oh\n[00:02.32]Oh, oh (Yeah, yeah), oh, oh\n[00:06.50](Out of here, out of here)\n[00:08.20]Wheezy, out of here\n[00:08.68](Out of here, out of here)\n[00:09.80]Ayy, Wheezy, we out of here\n[00:10.46](Out of here, out of here)\n[00:11.54]Ayy, Wheezy, we out of here\n[00:12.86](Out of here, out of here)\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD]\n[00:13.92]Uh, fell in love with her tongue, yeah, told bro he gotta try some\n[00:16.86]She say, \"Nigga, is you dumb? I ain't fuckin' both of y'all, only just one\"\n[00:20.32]Then she seen that money come, me countin' up Benjamin Franklins\n[00:23.80]Yeah, when she seen that, she took my brother to the room and said, \"I'll be right back\"\n[Verse 1: Juice WRLD]\n[00:27.46]Little bit of rock, little bit of rap\n[00:29.40]Sold a lot of rock, I don't gotta cap\n[00:31.24]I was in the trap totin' on the Glock\n[00:32.90]Whippin' on the stove, cookin' up the pot\n[00:34.40]Whole world in my hands, keep it on lock\n[00:36.36]Been through a lot shit, still shell-shocked\n[00:38.16]I got the juice, feel like 2Pac\n[00:39.50]They tryna kill me in the black Bimmer like 2Pac\n[00:41.90]I'm finna feed 'em the rounds\n[00:43.02]Finger-fuck the glizzy, I ain't fuckin' around\n[00:44.80]She fuckin' on me when her man out of town\n[00:46.60]We get up off them uppers, it go down\n[00:48.38]Smoke 'til my eyes look Ming, no Yao\n[00:49.96]I'ma ball on these niggas like Ming, no Yao\n[00:51.94]How you want beef, but you a pussy?\n[00:53.66]Never seen a kitty act like a cow\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD]\n[00:55.16]Uh, fell in love with her tongue, yeah, told bro he gotta try some\n[00:58.44]She say, \"Nigga, is you dumb? I ain't fuckin' both of y'all, only just one\"\n[01:01.90]Then she seen that money come, me countin' up Benjamin Franklins\n[01:05.40]Yeah, when she seen that, she took my brother to the room and said, \"I'll be right back\" (Uh)\n[Verse 2: Lil Durk]\n[01:08.64]Deep in her guts, she screamin' out facts (Facts)\n[01:30.26]Screamin', \"Free Thug,\" I'm screamin', \"Free Slatt\" (Slatt)\n[01:31.66]Let Melly out, I'm sorry 'bout X (X)\n[01:32.48]I know the owner, I took her to Catch (Oh)\n[01:33.56]Baby got off of Amiri, sayin' he all Chrome, but I'm bringin' him back\n[01:35.24]I hate the trollin' they do when you die\n[01:36.34]Honestly, them niggas really be foul (Yeah, yeah)\n[01:37.40]50 want to shoot a movie, but I was just tellin' him this real\n[01:38.92]On set in Chicago, anybody can get killed\n[01:40.04]The internet thinkin' they hurtin' me, stop it\n[01:41.34]I'm Smurkio, I gave out scholarships\n[01:42.18]The biggest before I was positive\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD]\n[01:43.20]Uh, fell in love with her tongue, yeah, told bro he gotta try some\n[01:45.00]She say, \"Nigga, is you dumb? I ain't fuckin' both of y'all, only just one\"\n[01:47.36]Then she seen that money come, me countin' up Benjamin Franklins\n[01:49.14]Yeah, when she seen that, she took my brother to the room and said, \"I'll be right back\"","words":[[2.02,2.16,"Oh,"],[2.22,2.24,"oh"],[2.32,2.34,"Oh,"],[2.52,4.72,"oh"],[4.76,4.84,"(Yeah,"],[4.88,4.94,"yeah),"],[5.6,5.86,"oh,"],[5.92,6.44,"oh"],[6.5,6.56,"(Out"],[6.6,6.62,"of"],[6.66,6.76,"here,"],[7.22,7.36,"out"],[7.46,7.48,"of"],[7.56,7.92,"here)"],[8.2,8.32,"Wheezy,"],[8.36,8.42,"out"],[8.46,8.48,"of"],[8.52,8.64,"here"],[8.68,8.82,"(Out"],[8.88,8.9,"of"],[8.94,9.04,"here,"],[9.42,9.46,"out"],[9.5,9.52,"of"],[9.58,9.76,"here)"],[9.8,9.86,"Ayy,"],[9.92,10.1,"Wheezy,"],[10.14,10.16,"we"],[10.2,10.24,"out"],[10.28,10.3,"of"],[10.34,10.42,"here"],[10.46,10.5,"(Out"],[10.56,10.58,"of"],[10.62,10.72,"here,"],[10.96,11.12,"out"],[11.18,11.2,"of"],[11.26,11.48,"here)"],[11.54,11.62,"Ayy,"],[11.68,11.86,"Wheezy,"],[11.92,11.98,"we"],[12.02,12.24,"out"],[12.3,12.32,"of"],[12.36,12.5,"here"],[12.86,12.92,"(Out"],[12.96,12.98,"of"],[13.04,13.16,"here,"],[13.4,13.72,"out"],[13.76,13.78,"of"],[13.82,13.88,"here)"],[13.92,13.94,"Uh,"],[13.98,14.08,"fell"]